# Deep Learning

- FEATURE_DIM **14**; lookback/granularity/`label_horizon_bars` do checkpoint devem bater com settings
- Label SSOT `quantum_multi_barrier` (alternativas: `triple_barrier`, `supertrend_atr`); horizonte **N=1 vela M5**; contrato ops **5 m**; treino em dados diários (**D1 / 86.400 s**, 365 barras)
- Sweep `horizon_sweep`: diagnostico offline (`enabled` **false**); grade M5 com $N \in [1, 2, 3, 4]$ barras; **nao** promover duracao ops ≠ 5 m; contrato live `duration=5`
- ACC / val_accuracy gate importa; nao ignorar deploy_gate; `allow_undeployed_inference` **false**; `training_history_bars` **2000**; gate pos-promote tambem aceita settle elegivel
- `train.py` vs `run.py`; meta offline em `scripts/operations/train_meta_*`
- Inferencia TCN = eager/CUDA **local no host** (`inference_mode`, batch 1); `inference_history_bars` inclui `causal_norm_window` **288** (piso ~334 velas M5); nao bloquear o event loop — offload se pesado; meta/loss HTTP sidecars com timeout/fallback
- Optuna/tuning offline: nao disputar VRAM com inferencia live; artefatos versionados no MinIO; meta payoff **unit-scaled O(1) no fold de treino** (sem escala no y completo); objetivo **regression_l1** + snapshot com gap MAE legal (0 = mediana L1; z/IR no mesmo snapshot; val purged completa); trim de prefixo ate o nulo L1 caber no teto; teto `val_mae/train_mae` **2.0** inalterado
- Sample weighting SSOT: `deep_learning.sample_weighting` — class balance + recency (`recency_half_life_n` default **500**); `compose_train_weights` no walkforward
- Majority-collapse no deploy: `reject_majority_collapse`, `max_label_call_frac_bias` (0.20), `min_minority_recall` (0.25); telemetria `label_call_frac` / `pred_call_frac` / `minority_recall`
- Calibracao: modo `raw_extreme` substituiu `tcn_macro_override` — raw extremo **nao** substitui Cal; Kelly usa Cal; `apply_calibrator_stable` devolve raw se margem raw > Cal; clamp `[raw±0.05]` **antes** do ramo raw_extreme; `min_calibration_margin_floor` **0.05**; `temperature_min` **0.75**; sharpness OOS **0.03**; TCN live sempre CALL se Cal ≥**0.5** senao PUT (sem `SKIP:NEUTRAL_ZONE`); call/put **0.55/0.45** nao skipam; banda `[0.45, 0.55]` so telemetria/`raw_extreme` (lado raw quando Cal mole); chaves `tcn_macro_*_override` so limiam raw (nao sao TF MACRO OHLC)
- Vies de classe corrige-se no treino/deploy, nao com veto de sinal live
- Doc: `docs/engineering-deep-learning.md` + `docs/engineering-architecture-senior.md`; skill: `aether-dl-train`

- Vetor TCN ortogonal **14D** (ultima dim `hurst_centered`) + normalizacao causal (`causal_norm_window` **288**, Median/IQR sem lookahead); `ema_50` **50**; limiares call/put **0.55/0.45**; meta **23D** (=14+9, microestrutura 1HZ75V no lugar de cross-symbol zerado). Checkpoints 34D/meta 43D invalidos (fail-closed).
